    "metchosin": "Use published Remuneration only: source footnote says it includes salary,wages,taxable benefits; adjacent Taxable Benefits is supporting information and must not be added again. Star indicates unused vacation/time-bank payouts included. Dunlop expense is blank/null; under-threshold expense n/a is unknown.",
