    "wells": "Mayor and Council2020 heading clearly establishes council scope/year; four expense0 cells literal. Conflicting Staff2018 heading remains held and is not dated from council rows.",
    "salmonArm": "Gross remuneration includes vacation/overtime banks. Separate expense-inclusive Total is excluded from remuneration. ChelseaChief visibly abuts but separates into Chelsea / Chief Financial Officer; Wilson visible title ends Coordinator/City, no painted Engineer; Frese visible clipped title remains ... Treatment Plan, not expanded to Plant.",
    "elkford": "Issuer OCR overlay is not native table/OCR-engine independence. All29 displayed rows checked in rendered scan. Council/employee columns separate; derived named employee controls use all-employee minus under-threshold aggregate; printed residuals preserved without inferred cause."
